# Never, under any circumstances. The source directory this was assembled from
# holds console crypto keys and game binaries next to our own sources, and the
# assembling script refuses them by name as well as by extension. Belt and
# braces, because one bad `git add -A` is unrecoverable once it is in history.
*.keys
prod.keys
title.keys
*.tik
*.cert

# Game and console binaries. We ship code that reads them, never them.
